VIEWMODEL.md G13, §16: view expressions are type-checked with TYPES.md: a group's `when` and a field's `when`, `readonly` and `hidden` must be Bool (E3002); a template and a search term are typed in the view's scope.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

local record Item {
  label: String
  count: Int
}

view Item {
  title "{label}"
  search { label, count }
  group main "Main" when count {
    label { when: label, readonly: 1, hidden: false }
  }
}
-- findings.txt --
error[E3002]  a/a.canon:11:26
  expected Bool, found Int

error[E3002]  a/a.canon:12:19
  expected Bool, found String

error[E3002]  a/a.canon:12:36
  expected Bool, found Int

